profile:
Black metal one-man band from Switzerland (Winterthur-Zürich originally, later relocated in Lucerne); 
founded in 2003.
Ivo Henzi: guitar, bass, vocals, synths, drumcomputer, programming.

Thrash metal band from Kaunas, Lithuania. "Tručas" (slang word being used in some parts of Lithuania meaning poison) is a 90s kids thrash band. The band started in 2011. From the beginning the guys wanted to play something orientated to thrash metal.

Members:
Matas - Bass/Vocals;
Minvydas - Guitar;
Tautvydas - Guitar;
Paulius - Drums.
